  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/tzadiqim">
          <tei:p>May thy compassion, Lord our God, be aroused over the righteous and over the godly; over the leaders of thy people, the house of Israel, and over the remnant of their sages; over the true proselytes and over us. Grant a good reward to all who truly trust<tei:pb n="90" ed="1949 chol/shacharit/amidah" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n114_medium.jpg"/> in thy name, and place our lot among them; may we never come to shame, for in thee we trust. Blessed art thou, O Lord, who art the stay and trust of the righteous.</tei:p>
        </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
